{
  "title": "Second-order stride memory does not improve exploratory Parkinson prediction across two gait collections",
  "abstract": "Stride-duration lag-two partial autocorrelation did not improve exploratory Parkinson/control prediction across two public gait collections: external logloss increased from 0.403740 to 0.415818; joint-bootstrap95% interval for the change [-0.04561498233706755, 0.13744234141407524]. This is not evidence of equivalence or a validated biomarker.",
